      <p>This reference guide indexes the <em>cluster Operators</em> shipped by Red Hat that serve as the architectural foundation for OpenShift Container Platform. Cluster Operators are installed by default, unless otherwise noted, and are managed by the Cluster Version Operator (CVO). For more details on the control plane architecture, see <a href="/architecture/control-plane#operators-overview_control-plane">Operators in OpenShift Container Platform</a>.</p>
      <p>Cluster administrators can view cluster Operators in the OpenShift Container Platform web console from the <strong>Administration</strong> -&gt; <strong>Cluster Settings</strong> page.</p>
